    "saturation_interpretation": "Steering saturation and instability timing are retained as descriptive diagnostics. They are not a causal conclusion or a post-hoc selection surface.",
    "godot_implementation_hypothesis": "R23D2's common Godot result was a post-physics execution-summary retention/accounting defect. Retained terminal ticks support, but cannot promote into a reconstructed R23D2 report, the hypothesis that the adaptive contact-gated Godot horizon produced fewer than the hard-coded 2992 controller steps. R23D3 must execute an explicit fixed 2992-step Godot authority horizon and expose every exact observed subpredicate before any Godot cell can be execution-valid."
